## Workload spoke addressing

Per [ADR 0017](decisions/0017-workload-spokes-are-per-estate.md) the factory
builds no workload spokes: they are per-estate work inside this repository,
against the connectivity layer's outputs. The ranges below were chosen during
the engagement and validated for overlap against the hub, and they are recorded
here because an addressing decision that lives only in an answer record gets
made twice.

